editor_description = "Every room's floor, under its carpet. Each room gets one (Room.make_floor_and_ceiling), never turned with the room, so the floor lines up from room to room.
Only carpet is in the Floor group, so this can't be teleported onto. Its top sits below the carpet's, so the teleport ray finds the carpet."

